<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>How can I spend my time</l><l>That it’d be valuable,</l><l>Thousand-fold multiplied,</l><l>Ever our memorial?</l><l>I’d rather spend a day,</l><l>With Thee and with Thy saints,</l><l>Than thousand days away.</l><l>One thing, that do I seek,</l><l>To dwell within Thy house</l><l>Beholding Thee always.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
